flowchart LR
    START([Frame]) --> G1{Busy?}
    G1 -->|Yes| SKIP[/Discard/]
    G1 -->|No| G2{&lt; 150 ms?}
    G2 -->|Yes| SKIP
    G2 -->|No| ENC[Convert<br/>to JPEG]
    ENC --> MP[Native<br/>MediaPipe]
    MP --> F{Face<br/>found?}
    F -->|No| ZERO[No-face result<br/>all zeros]
    F -->|Yes| EXT[6 blendshapes<br/>+ mouth box]
    ZERO --> LIP
    EXT --> LIP[LipsingDetector<br/>adds isLipsing]
    LIP --> LET[LipLetterDetector<br/>adds letter]
    LET --> UI[setState<br/>redraw]
    UI --> FIN[/finally:<br/>clear flag/]
    FIN --> END([Next frame])

    style G1 fill:#eef2fb,stroke:#3b3a8f
    style G2 fill:#eef2fb,stroke:#3b3a8f
    style FIN fill:#fdf3e2,stroke:#8c5a00
